  "_town": "D251: what Muck Muck builds at the crater, ordered from him in Stormreach (data/areas/city_streets.json): each building, its people and its props stand once its flag is set (town:smithy, town:infirmary, town:wall), and clear the ground under and round them. The wall is the timber walls round the place (walls_requires). Inferred: every name, place and word (agenda row 164).",
